ンが一本入っている。\nリボンは赤色のネクタイ型（先に形に沿った2本の白いライン）\n\nスカートは襟元と同じ色の紺色。\n長さは膝よりほんの少し短め。\n\n黒のニーハイソックスを着用\n\n靴は茶色のローファー\n\nその他詳細\n・図書委員の女の子\n・オカルト系にも興味を持ち、そのまま古文や考古学まで手を伸ばす興味を持ったら突き走る性格\n・やっかいな頼まれごとや目立つ事を回避する為【忍び歩き】が成長した\n・気の知れた仲だと「ふへへ」と笑ったり、めんどくさい時はめんどくさいと口より顔で語るタイプ。\n\n表情差分があるととても嬉しいです。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 858032, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Ame寸", "screen_name": "Amesunsun00", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1965644444528771074/TwVsnpsd.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1169466951367704576/1746713704/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 2, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 2441847, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "かかりいつき", "screen_name": "kkr_itk_go", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1999013829624344580/3jXsfiR1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1465559486253641729/1777641043/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 3274813, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "花間るい", "screen_name": "rui_hnm", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1805846769043128321/kHyziTu6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2419777836/1726369902/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_